{"candidateAnswer":"Adopted Buddy and Scout; hikes, walks, picnics, bike rides, rock climbing, camping, board games, and shelter volunteering.","evidence":"[D14:27 | 11:05 am on 4 August, 2023] Andrew: Thanks! Gotta take Toby out for a small hike at the local trail. Ttyl!\n[D24:8 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Andrew: Yeah, Buddy and I have a great time doing walks. It's a nice way to spend time together and get some fresh air.","itemId":"urn:uuid:30ff921c-3969-5d44-9806-5674ed44ead7","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ba764c617d0d07d2f64d91e15bfe605c3db8ea5ed060ee05286b1df860d9d34a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What has Andrew done with his dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Taking walks and hiking","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ba764c617d0d07d2f64d91e15bfe605c3db8ea5ed060ee05286b1df860d9d34a"}}]}